        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-allometric-cranial-sutures-audit-v2-bailleul-allometric-cranial-sutures-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-allometric-cranial-sutures-audit-v2-bailleul-allometric-cranial-sutures-2>,
