            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-allometric-cranial-sutures-audit-v2-bailleul-allometric-cranial-sutures-4>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-allometric-cranial-sutures-audit-v2-bailleul-allometric-cranial-sutures-5>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-allometric-cranial-sutures-audit-v2-bailleul-allometric-cranial-sutures-6> ;
