onant control, and Brandon et al. (2011) medial-septum inactivation (l=0, alpha=0) pinned-bump control | Automated CV segmentation of the Rattus norvegicus hippocampal-entorhinal immunofluorescence micrograph (N=902 NeuN+ neuronal somata, 50-bin dorso-ventral laminar density profile r=0.9822, and MBP+ perforant-path fiber fraction); transfer_boundary: Normalized 2D periodic neural sheet S(x,t) on [0, 2*pi)^2 mapped onto the 270x270 cm open-field foraging arena via velocity-integrated phase Phi(t); does_not_claim: Biophysical HCN1 h-current single-channel gating kinetics or border-cell environmental wall shearing]" ;
