    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-cervera-levin-mafe> a pk:Claim ;
        rdfs:label "Cervera–Levin–Mafe gap-junction reaction–diffusion and bioelectric synthesis (Planarians; photograph is Schmidtea mediterranea, empirical PlanformDB subset is Dugesia japonica)",
            "Cervera–Levin–Mafe gap-junction reaction–diffusion and bioelectric synthesis faithfully reproduces Planarians; photograph is Schmidtea mediterranea, empirical PlanformDB subset is Dugesia japonica morphology" ;
        dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/cervera-levin-mafe-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/cervera-levin-mafe-2> ;
        dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2021-Cervera–Levin–Mafe.py, 2013-lobo-planform-morphology.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Planarians; photograph is Schmidtea mediterranea, empirical PlanformDB subset is Dugesia japonica specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 55.6/100, audit 2026-10-17-cervera-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
        dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/a0d6848/2013-lobo-planform-morphology.py>,
            <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/a0d6848/2021-Cervera–Levin–Mafe.py> ;
        schema:about "Planarians; photograph is Schmidtea mediterranea, empirical PlanformDB subset is Dugesia japonica" ;
        schema:additionalProperty "does_not_claim: Exact equation-by-equation identity with the paywalled Cervera et al. (2021) full text or continuous 2D/3D biomechanical tissue deformation",
            "reconstructed_in_script: 1D AP (m1, m2) and ML (m3) reaction-diffusion analogue coupled with a 5-node bistable V_mem circuit port from MesmerPrism/rusty-matter and PlanformDB 2.5.0 canonical silhouettes",
            "reported_in_source: Cervera, Levin & Mafe (2021) model intercellular gap-junction blockade via effective diffusion reduction across AP (f2) and ML (f3) morphogen signals",
            "reported_in_source: Oviedo et al. (2010) and Durant et al. (2019) report crop-position-dependent double-head frequencies under octanol and triple-innexin RNAi and permanent two-headed regeneration after transient bioelectric depolarization",
            "transfer_boundary: One-parameter octanol crop-gradient calibration transferred to held-out triple-innexin RNAi crop frequencies" ;
        pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/a0d6848/2021-Cervera–Levin–Mafe.py, https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/a0d6848/2013-lobo-planform-morphology.py; output: cervera_levin_mafe_gj_block.gif; organism: Planarians; photograph is Schmidtea mediterranea, empirical PlanformDB subset is Dugesia japonica; checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/a0d6848; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.5.4, matplotlib 3.10.7, Pillow 12.0.0, scipy 1.16.3, scikit-image 0.26.0; spec_fingerprint: ca184becec2bf47d8a969d42711868cd85769dd013f7492905afdaf9707bf2fc; artifact_sha256: 3f521835636f3530ddf73b0ea3142db13d605b319aac93fc940e3d8f07fc5f77; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/planform/planform_canonical_silhouettes_v1.json=cac26e64a315ed81...}; supersedes_audit_id: 2026-10-17-cervera-audit; claim_boundary: [reported_in_source: Cervera, Levin & Mafe (2021) model intercellular gap-junction blockade via effective diffusion reduction across AP (f2) and ML (f3) morphogen signals | Oviedo et al. (2010) and Durant et al. (2019) report crop-position-dependent double-head frequencies under octanol and triple-innexin RNAi and permanent two-headed regeneration after transient bioelectric depolarization; reconstructed_in_script: 1D AP (m1, m2) and ML (m3) reaction-diffusion analogue coupled with a 5-node bistable V_mem circuit port from MesmerPrism/rusty-matter and PlanformDB 2.5.0 canonical silhouettes; transfer_boundary: One-parameter octanol crop-gradient calibration transferred to held-out triple-innexin RNAi crop frequencies; does_not_claim: Exact equation-by-equation identity with the paywalled Cervera et al. (2021) full text or continuous 2D/3D biomechanical tissue deformation]; other sources: Smediterranea.jpg, from A Low Percent Ethanol Method for Immobilizing Planarians <https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Smediterranea.jpg>, MesmerPrism/rusty-matter planarian bioelectric circuit and fixtures <https://github.co