-regime genetic & metabolic perturbation series (mouse WT, mouse + hHES7 swap, human WT, human + LbNOX NAD+ rescue, human + sodium azide ETC inhibition, and intronless Hes7 subcritical collapse; Pearson r = 0.9999, RMSE = 2.18 min) | 6-species vertebrate segmentation clock allometry (r = 0.9970), human axioloid traveling-wave kymograph, and bilateral dorsal somite row DoG segmentation on human_somite_organoid_specimen.jpg (47.14 px mean spacing, CV = 0.2010); transfer_boundary: Single-cell and 1D/2D axioloid HES7 DDE kinetics compared with dorsal vertebrate paraxial somite SEM metameric periodicity; does_not_claim: Full 3D actomyosin apical constriction mechanics during epithelial somite rosette clefting]" ;
