            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-corticothalamic-seizure-spirals-audit-v2-ermentrout-corticothalamic-seizure-spirals-3>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/2026-10-19-corticothalamic-seizure-spirals-audit-v2-ermentrout-corticothalamic-seizure-spirals-4>,
