        dct:description "The simulation script(s) 2020-kriegman-xenobot-evolutionary-biobots.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Xenopus laevis (African clawed frog blastula ectoderm & cardiac progenitor biobots) specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 91.3/100, audit 2026-10-19-xenobot-evolutionary-biobots-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
        dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/317bc3c/2020-kriegman-xenobot-evolutionary-biobots.py> ;
        schema:about "Xenopus laevis (African clawed frog blastula ectoderm & cardiac progenitor biobots)" ;
        schema:additionalProperty "does_not_claim: Full 3D fluid-structure Stokes ciliary boundary-element hydrodynamics or single-cell transcriptomic reprogramming after laceration",
            "reconstructed_in_script: 2D sagittal 8x5 voxel spring-lattice locomotion simulator across 5 experimental regimes, 60-generation AFPO pareto evolution, and 2D arena kinematic stem-cell compaction across mouth angles theta_mouth in [0, 120] deg",
