 rescue (PRP = 14.5 somites, R_min = 0.283 -> rescued R = 0.986) | Bilateral dorsal somite row DoG peak and inter-somitic cleft segmentation on zebrafish_psm_synchrony_specimen.jpg (48.47 px mean spacing, symmetry ratio 0.9605); transfer_boundary: 2D delayed Kuramoto PSM phase lattice and 1D clock-gated somite boundary profile mapped to dorsal vertebrate SEM somite metameres; does_not_claim: Full 3D cell-sorting advection in the tailbud progenitor zone or explicit Mib1 E3 ubiquitin ligase endocytosis stoichiometry]" ;
