    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-santella-wormguides-celegans> a pk:Claim ;
        rdfs:label "WormGUIDES C. elegans embryo atlas with the OpenWorm connectome (Caenorhabditis elegans embryo, 4-cell stage to ~580 nuclei (strain JIM113, diSPIM series DISPIM_061416))",
