            "reconstructed_in_script: 64x64 coupled 2D spectral viscous epiblast Stokes solver (Green's function L2 error = 5.97e-16) + active nematic Myosin-II cable advection-alignment PDE + Cauchy-Green FTLE attractor ridge integration across all 5 experimental regimes and a 15x15 (delta_m x beta_m) parameter morphospace",
            "reconstructed_in_script: Automated computer-vision segmentation of HH1 Koller's sickle crescent (61x183 px, AP/ML = 0.3333), HH2 condensing mesendoderm (78x149 px, AP/ML = 0.5235), HH3+ primitive streak (135x81 px, AP/ML = 1.6667, 5.00x AP/ML elongation), area pellucida to area opaca radius ratio (0.6250 vs 0.6389 ref), and HH2 Polonaise PIV bilateral vortex symmetry (0.9705) on chick_primitive_streak_specimen.jpg",
            "reported_in_source: Saadaoui, Rocancourt, Roussel, Corson & Gros (2020) Science 367:453-458 viscous epiblast Stokes model eta*nabla^2 v + eta_b*nabla(nabla.v) = -nabla.(m Q) showing that a posterior-graded marginal Myosin-II tensile ring m(theta) = m_0 + delta_m cos(theta) and apical mesendoderm ingression drive counter-rotating Polonaise twin vortices and midline primitive streak elongation",
            "reported_in_source: Serra et al. (2023) Nat. Methods 20:1739-1748 mechanochemical active nematic feedback (Dm/Dt and DQ_{ij}/Dt) and Finite-Time Lyapunov Exponent (FTLE) Dynamic Morphogenetic Skeleton demonstrating transition from a wild-type linear streak to a circular ring under FGF receptor inhibition (SU5402) or twin streaks under ectopic Vg1/Wnt induction",
            "transfer_boundary: 2D planar circular epiblast continuum sheet of radius R = 1.15 mm calibrated to Saadaoui et al. (2020) light-sheet PIV speeds, Serra et al. (2023) FTLE attractors, and Vasiev et al. (2010) whole-blastoderm Wnt8c/Chordin micrographs" ;
