    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-coccolith-emiliania-calcite-rosette-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Young et al. (1992) & Jaya et al. (2016) Emiliania huxleyi V/R calcite crystal coccolith rosette shield & interlocking spherical coccosphere mechanics — MorphoEval overall 91.7/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) remediated evaluation of `2022-coccolith-emiliania-calcite-rosette.py` (consensus score 91.8/100, up from 52.2/100 in Pass 1). The remediated script implements the 3D Young et al. (1992) V/R bimodal crystallographic nucleation ring (`N_total = 2*N_seg`, exact c-axis orthogonality `c_V . c_R = 0`, `90.0 deg`) and Didymus et al. (1993) stage-specific T-shaped hammer-element growth across *E. huxleyi* morphotypes A, B, C, and R plus an ocean acidification (`Omega_calcite = 0.75 < 1.0`) and CAP-polysaccharide ablation control (`w_head / w_shaft = 1.00`), validates linear proto-coccolith scaling `L_d(N_seg)` across 12 coccolithophore taxa (`r = 1.0000`), models 3D spherical coccosphere Voronoi/Delaunay Euler packing (`V - E + F = 2`, `3V = 2E`, `2.36x` buckling amplification, Jaya et al. 2016), and performs elliptical polar DoG segmentation on the vendored *Emiliania huxleyi* SEM micrograph (`N_seg = 32` spokes, `11.25 deg` pitch, `b/a = 0.8478`, `L_d = 3.50 um`), backed by 4 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems. Overall 91.7/100 (faithfulness 91.4, reproducibility 92.3); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit HEAD; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 93, Morphological realism / specimen match 90, Parameter expressivity 91, Morphometric validation 92, Source and data traceability 94, Code-to-model traceability 92, Reproducibility package 91. Output judged: docs/media/emiliania_calcite_rosette_comparison.png: rendered output of 2022-coccolith-emiliania-calcite-rosette.py at HEAD, image/png, 746932 B, 2259×1420 px, artifact_sha256 c8cb64fc4aaef13f875191852da6a4cb969268ae4526765145bcd5ea3ba757a6 (sha256 c8cb64fc4aaef13f875191852da6a4cb969268ae4526765145bcd5ea3ba757a6), spec_fingerprint a04d4ad3be794a2a2b64ad6ba6e976c1273468b393c25601eaba7d3808a4fc31. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: a04d4ad3be794a2a2b64ad6ba6e976c1273468b393c25601eaba7d3808a4fc31; artifact_sha256: c8cb64fc4aaef13f875191852da6a4cb969268ae4526765145bcd5ea3ba757a6; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/emiliania_calcite_rosette/emiliania_calcite_rosette_reference.json=6e0133f11f7fd993..., datasets/emiliania_calcite_rosette/emiliania_huxleyi_coccolith_specimen.jpg=94d4b431c4912727..., datasets/emiliania_calcite_rosette/scout_manifest.json=d838aa9cca83725c...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-emiliania-calcite-rosette-audit." ;
