    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-santella-wormguides-celegans-specimen-match> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "WormGUIDES C. elegans embryo atlas with the OpenWorm connectome — Morphological realism / specimen match: 62/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-16"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Re-scored from 60. The re-derived lineage chart has the shape of Sulston's diagram (founder sub-trees in order, AB dominating, P4 ending in two cells); the nuclei are now drawn inside the atlas's eggshell outline, which fills the 50 x 29 um egg and shows the cloud growing out to the shell, and gastrulation shows as the E cells moving inward. Distinct stages are visually distinct. The gain is small because the shell is the atlas's segmentation, not a photograph: no DIC frame or WormGUIDES screenshot is placed beside the output, the WormAtlas images are only cited, and the meshes at frame 330 are drawn as flat projections, so resemblance to the real embryo is still argued from counts and extents rather than shown side by side." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-specimen-match> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/specimen-match" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-santella-wormguides-celegans-specimen-match-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-santella-wormguides-celegans-specimen-match-2>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-santella-wormguides-celegans-specimen-match-3>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-santella-wormguides-celegans-specimen-match-4> ;
        pk:hasScore 6.2e-01 ;
        pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Savin et al. (2011) Kirchhoff elastic rod + stretched neo-Hookean dorsal mesentery gut looping morphogenesis — Code-to-model traceability: 92/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Module and function docstrings map every equation to Savin et al. (2011) Figs. 1-4 & Supplementary Sec. S2-S4, Nerurkar et al. (2017) PNAS Figs. 2-3, Kurpios et al. (2008) PNAS, and the 3 formal Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_062_gut_looping_differential_growth.lean` (L1-42, L114-165)." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
