        pk:hasScore 9.2e-01 ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Savin et al. (2011) Kirchhoff elastic rod + stretched neo-Hookean dorsal mesentery gut looping morphogenesis — Model fidelity to source: 94/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Implements Savin et al.'s (2011) exact differential strain epsilon = (L_t - L_m)/L_m, annular second moment of area I_t = (pi/4)*(R_t^4 - R_i^4), cube-root characteristic length ell_* = (E_t*I_t / (E_m*h_m))^(1/3) (L114-144), and a 120-node 3D discrete Kirchhoff elastic rod + stretched neo-Hookean dorsal mesentery L-BFGS-B energy minimizer (`relax_kirchhoff_gut_rod`, L149-292) with surgical mesentery ablation (epsilon = 0 -> straight unlooped rod, tortuosity = 1.0000) and BMP2/Noggin perturbation controls (L434-478), backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_062_gut_looping_differential_growth.lean`." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth-model-fidelity-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth-model-fidelity-2>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth-model-fidelity-3> ;
        pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Savin et al. (2011) Kirchhoff elastic rod + stretched neo-Hookean dorsal mesentery gut looping morphogenesis — Morphometric validation: 93/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L856-949) computes 9 reference-anchored morphometric measurements with uncertainty and statistical tests: 4-species wavelength Pearson r = 0.9999 (p = 3.5e-24, RMSE = 0.025 mm), 4-species radius Pearson r = 0.9999 (p = 1.9e-23, RMSE = 0.010 mm), log-log scaling exponent alpha = 0.9963 ± 0.0044 (ref 1.0), Chick E12 relaxed 3D rod wavelength 3.1132 mm (ref 3.12 mm) and radius 1.1499 mm (ref 1.15 mm), surgical ablation tortuosity 1.0000 (ref 1.0), BMP2/Noggin loop-count ratio 1.8581 (ref 2.0909), specimen inter-loop spacing CV = 0.2319, and cross-species lambda/R = 2.7126 (ref 2.7083)." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth-measurement-4-species-gut-loop-radius-of-curvature-scaling-correlation-savin-et-al-2011-fig-4f>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth-measurement-4-species-gut-loop-wavelength-scaling-correlation-savin-et-al-2011-fig-4e>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth-measurement-biological-specimen-segmented-inter-loop-wavelength-cv-intestine-mesentery-specimen-jpg>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth-measurement-bmp2-vs-noggin-loop-count-modulation-ratio-at-e12-nerurkar-et-al-2017-pnas>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth-measurement-chick-e12-3d-kirchhoff-rod-relaxed-loop-radius-r-sim>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth-measurement-chick-e12-3d-kirchhoff-rod-relaxed-loop-wavelength-lambda-sim>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth-measurement-cross-species-log-log-power-law-scaling-exponent-alpha-lambda-ell-alpha>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth-measurement-surgical-mesentery-ablation-negative-control-tortuosity-epsilon-0-vs-e12-wild-type>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth-measurement-universal-dimensionless-wavelength-to-radius-invariant-lambda-r-across-4-vertebrates>,
            <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth-morphometric-validation-1> ;
        pk:hasScore 9.3e-01 ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Savin et al. (2011) Kirchhoff elastic rod + stretched neo-Hookean dorsal mesentery gut looping morphogenesis — MorphoEval overall 92.4/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) evaluation of `2011-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth.py` (overall weighted score: 92.6/100, up from 56.4/100 in v1). The remediated script relaxes a 120-node 3D discrete Kirchhoff elastic rod coupled to a stretched neo-Hookean dorsal mesentery sheet via L-BFGS-B energy minimization; reproduces Savin et al.'s (2011) universal cube-law scaling collapse across 14 developmental stages in 4 vertebrate species (zebra finch, quail, chick, mouse; r = 0.9999, RMSE = 0.025 mm, log-log exponent alpha = 0.9963 ± 0.0044); validates surgical mesentery ablation (epsilon = 0 -> 0 loops, tortuosity = 1.0000) and Nerurkar et al. (2017) BMP2/Noggin perturbations; and segments the SHA-256-locked biological specimen image (`intestine_mesentery_specimen.jpg`, 76 loop apices, CV = 0.2319). Overall 92.4/100 (faithfulness 91.9, reproducibility 93.4); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 90, Parameter expressivity 91, Morphometric validation 93, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 92, Reproducibility package 93. Output judged: docs/media/gut_looping_differential_growth_comparison.png: rendered output of 2011-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth.py at 8871db0, image/png, 952385 B, 2119×1452 px, artifact_sha256 cb61655dfbcbf3d212d1088294b500e3b21838e47decc5f9fb24cc8630af7b2d (sha256 cb61655dfbcbf3d212d1088294b500e3b21838e47decc5f9fb24cc8630af7b2d), spec_fingerprint 643f6989deff1f1d47f576fe1e43c257f747c5e39321e10638b972d0ac0dc491. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 643f6989deff1f1d47f576fe1e43c257f747c5e39321e10638b972d0ac0dc491; artifact_sha256: cb61655dfbcbf3d212d1088294b500e3b21838e47decc5f9fb24cc8630af7b2d; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/gut_looping_differential_growth/gut_looping_differential_growth_reference.json=f73121bb4140187f..., datasets/gut_looping_differential_growth/intestine_mesentery_specimen.jpg=e12fee9ac1fb5f3d..., datasets/gut_looping_differential_growth/paper_citations.bib=21703c48df51dd52..., datasets/gut_looping_differential_growth/scout_manifest.json=0723b42b4d825087...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-gut-looping-differential-growth-audit." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 3D discrete Kirchhoff rod to a full 2D finite-element triangular mesh of the fan-shaped dorsal mesentery with spatially varying apicobasal Pitx2 stiffness gradients." ;
        pk:hasScore 9.24e-01 ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-savin-gut-looping-differential-growth-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Savin et al. (2011) Kirchhoff elastic rod + stretched neo-Hookean dorsal mesentery gut looping morphogenesis — Parameter expressivity: 91/100" ;
